<title>BELGIUM: Belgian tax receipts up 3.9 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Belgian tax receipts up 3.9 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up 3.2 percent in December 1996 from December 1995 and up 3.9 percent in 1996 from a year earlier, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Monday.  </p>
<p>TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Dec 96	 Dec 95     pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  263,951	255,830	3.2</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    164,009	147,891     10.9</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes   83,371	 78,759	5.9</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Dec 96   Jan-Dec 95 pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  2,278,957    2,192,954    3.9</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    1,316,902    1,281,759    2.7</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes    614,296	589,292    4.2</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
